  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>DecorationCreateAnInventoryOfSeveralOrganizations</name>
    <id>41</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>If there is no inventory register for the required company in the list, &lt;link CreateInventory>generate&lt;/> it.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>اگر دفتر ثبت موجودی برای شرکت مورد نظر در فهرست نیست، آن را &lt;link CreateInventory>ایجاد کنید&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Если в списке нет описи по необходимой организации, &lt;link CreateInventory>сформируйте&lt;/> опись.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Liste, gerekli iş yeri için &lt;link CreateInventory> envanter içermiyorsa, envanter &lt;/> oluştur.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Nếu trong danh sách không có bản kiểm kê theo doanh nghiệp cần thiết, hãy &lt;link CreateInventory>lập bảng kê&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>If there is no inventory register for the required company in the list, &lt;link CreateInventory>generate&lt;/> it.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>If there is no inventory register for the required company in the list, &lt;link CreateInventory>generate&lt;/> it.</value>
    </title>
