  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>DecorationFormActs</name>
    <id>44</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Inventory adjustments were not created for all discrepancies. It is recommended that you print the inventory register when this process is complete. &lt;link RegisterWarehouseActs>Create inventory adjustments&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>تعدیلات موجودی برای همه مغایرت‌ها ایجاد نشدند. توصیه می‌شود پس از تکمیل این فرایند دفتر ثبت موجودی را چاپ کنید. &lt;link RegisterWarehouseActs>ایجاد تعدیلات موجودی&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Не по всем расхождениям оформлены складские акты. Рекомендуется печатать опись, когда этот процесс завершен. &lt;link RegisterWarehouseActs>Оформить складские акты&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Tüm tutarsızlıklar için stok düzeltmeleri düzenlenmemiştir. Bu işlem tamamlandığında envanterin yazdırılması önerilmektedir. &lt;link RegisterWarehouseActs>Stok düzeltmeleri düzenle&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Không phải tất cả chênh lệch đều được lập biên bản kho. Nên in bản kê, nếu quy trình này đã kết thúc. &lt;link RegisterWarehouseActs>Lập biên bản kho&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Inventory adjustments were not created for all discrepancies. It is recommended that you print the inventory register when this process is complete. &lt;link RegisterWarehouseActs>Create inventory adjustments&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Inventory adjustments were not created for all discrepancies. It is recommended that you print the inventory register when this process is complete. &lt;link RegisterWarehouseActs>Create inventory adjustments&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>DecorationFormActsExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>46</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>DecorationFormActsContextMenu</name>
      <id>45</id>
